claim.claim-text:
identifying, using a camera (102) coupled to a vehicle travelling on a road, a pedestrian crossing the road;
determining that the pedestrian is far from a crosswalk;
determining whether a driver of the vehicle performs an action that is responsive to the pedestrian crossing the road far from a crosswalk;
assessing a risk of a collision event between the vehicle and the pedestrian after the driver of the vehicle performed the action;
comparing the risk of the collision event after the driver of the vehicle performed the action with a risk assessment of a predicted collision event had the driver not performed the action;
generating an alert notification based on a determination that the action mitigated the risk of the collision event; and
communicating a positive reinforcement to the driver.
